    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this well presented and perfectly located 2 bedroom mid terrace property with the additional benefit of a converted attic to the market in the highly sought after Oak Downs, Clondalkin, Dublin 22. This Property is located in the mature Greenpark development which has a wealth of amenities close by, Clondalkin Village, The Mill Shopping centre, Clondalkin Leisure centre, Corkagh Park and a selection of Primary & Secondary schools are all within walking distance, the area is also well serviced by bus routes, the LUAS and road networks such as the M50 & N7. With living accommodation of c. 76 Sqm, in brief this property consists of; Entrance hall, living room and kitchen/diner to the ground floor. On the first floor you will find two bedrooms, the family bathroom and staircase up to the converted attic. Externally you will find a fully enclosed WEST facing garden whilst the front offers a driveway for off road parking. Number 37 comes to the market in good condition throughout and its location is next to none, based on recent success in the development we are sure this property will be highly popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your early interest.\n\n\nBER E2\nc.76 Sqm\n2 Bedrooms\nAttic conversion\n1 Bath\nPopular location\nEasy access to N7 & M50\nGas central heating\nClose to amenities\nDriveway to front\nDouble glazed windows\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nTravelling out of Clondalkin Village take the Boot Road and turn right onto the Old Naas Road towards The Green Isle Hotel. Take your second turn right onto Oak Way, continue to the bottom of the road and turn left onto Oak Downs.\n"
      },
      {
